  designNotes: 'Wish (the user, 2026-10-17): a Prayer on target friendly creature''s
    slot for 2 Days: when they run out, at the end of the next Day, whoever stands
    in that slot heals 6. Help that arrives late, for whoever is still there to receive
    it.'
  artDescription: A hospital bed with a bandaged creature in it, a GET WELL SOON
    balloon drifting in through the window two days late, and outside, a crowd of
    politicians with their hands clasped and eyes closed, each holding a phone showing
    the hashtag #thoughtsandprayers.
